<nicolas....@gmail.com> wrote:
>
>  The problem seems to be fixed when the last patches (20080508) are
>  applied.

That's good news.

The explanation is then likely to be that when fitting the
fragment-length normalization model on unit subset '-XY' (all units
but those on ChrX and ChrY), we identify the units as "all units"
minus getUnitsOnChromosome(gi, chromosomes=23:24).  We the bug in the
latter, that might results in something like "all units minus all
units" giving no units to fit the model on.

Cheers

Henrik

